# Schema: Polkadot SDK PRDoc Schema (prdoc) v1.0.0
# See doc at https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/master/prdoc/schema_user.json

title: "[pallet-staking] Refactor test modules into separate files"

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Splits the monolithic `substrate/frame/staking/src/tests.rs` (9,401 lines) into
      a `tests/` folder where each named module lives in its own file. No logic or
      behaviour is changed; this is a pure readability and navigability improvement.

      The new layout:
        - `tests/mod.rs` — top-level (unmodded) tests and module declarations
        - `tests/election_data_provider.rs`
        - `tests/sorted_list_provider.rs`
        - `tests/staking_interface.rs`
        - `tests/staking_unchecked.rs`
        - `tests/ledger.rs`
        - `tests/ledger_recovery.rs`
        - `tests/validator_disabling_integration.rs`
        - `tests/migration_tests.rs`
        - `tests/getters.rs`
        - `tests/hold_migration.rs`

      Closes #3178.

crates:
  - name: pallet-staking
    bump: patch
